<title>AUSTRALIA: Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - July 9.</title>
<headline>Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - July 9.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>			     Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		    Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Mt Leyshon Gold	16.03    1.56</p>
<p> 2   Cudgen R.Z.	    10.20    2.45</p>
<p> 3   Aust Tour		 9.49    0.79</p>
<p> 4   Natl Consol	     9.47    0.95</p>
<p> 5   Prime Credit Tr	 9.27    1.05</p>
<p> 6   Prop Income Inv	 8.85    1.14</p>
<p> 7   BT Prop Trust	   8.68    1.88</p>
